        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Select Desired DISP Level",
          "box": {
            "x": 234,
            "y": 1157,
            "w": 974,
            "h": 56
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Select Desired DISP Level\nEntry Level\nLevel 1\nLevel 2\nLevel 3\n\nIt's Suited to most businesses; We have developed a fixed-price package designed to bring companies into compliance with Entry Level DISP in a short time-frame. \n\nCompliance with Entry Level will grant access to OFFICIAL: Sensitive information. \n\n​\n\nSO & CSO Selection & Training\n\nGap Analysis & Action Plan\n\nGovernance & Security Documentation\n\nPhysical & Cyber Security Support\n\nApplication & Interview Preparation\n\nDoD Response & Compliance\n\nOngoing Support: Meetings, Maintenance, 3-Month Assistance\n \n\nWhy Entry Level DISP?\nDISP’s Entry Level or Baseline tier has been designed by the department to bring organisations to modern information security standards. Upon approval of your entry level application, your organisation will be cleared for up to and including Official: Sensitive Information.\n \n\nIn our experience, Entry level DISP is sufficient for the majority of companies in the supply chain.",
      "links": [],
      "images": []
    },
