      ],
      "text": "DISP Eligibility\n\nWe guide you through every requirement to achieve full DISP compliance and maintain your certification.\n\nAustralian Presence: Your business must operate in Australia and have an ABN.\n \n\nSecurity Commitment: Be ready to implement security policies and nominate responsible personnel.\n \n\nTransparency: Disclose ownership structure and any foreign influence.",
